This product includes a re-implementation of the ellipsoid fluid model from
MuJoCo (https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco), specifically the algorithms
in src/engine/engine_passive.c (mj_viscousForces, mj_addedMassForces) and the
compile-time added-mass coefficients of src/user/user_objects.cc.  MuJoCo is
Copyright DeepMind Technologies Limited and is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.  No MuJoCo source code is included in this distribution; the model is
re-derived and re-implemented in PyTorch, and its agreement with MuJoCo is
verified numerically in source/isaacswim/test/test_mujoco_parity.py.

The vehicle interface (a robot carrying named actuators and sensors) follows the
design of Stonefish (https://github.com/patrykcieslak/stonefish, GPL-3.0).  No
Stonefish source code is included.

isaacswim.oceansim_render copies OceanSim's published water constants
(https://github.com/umfieldrobotics/OceanSim, BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c)
2024-2025 The OceanSim Project Developers) and evaluates its
underwater image model; OceanSim's kernels and sensors are imported from the
installed extension, not distributed.

isaacswim.assets downloads, at build time and into a local cache, third-party
material that is NOT distributed with this product and is NOT covered by its
licence:
  * the stock BlueROV2 Heavy description from
    https://github.com/edxmorgan/uvms-simulator (AGPL-3.0-or-later);
  * Reach Robotics' Alpha 5 description and meshes from
    https://github.com/Robotic-Decision-Making-Lab/alpha, under Reach Robotics'
    license, which the builder keeps verbatim with every generated file;
  * Robotiq's Isaac Sim 2F-85 asset from https://github.com/robotiq/isaacsim_assets
    (Robotiq content BSD-3-Clause; portions adapted from NVIDIA Corporation's
    asset under CC BY 4.0), whose licenses and attribution the builder keeps
    with the generated files.
